    <!-- Apotheosis: a navigation sequence played through the harness path on startup. It ships inside the
         package because Device Portal on the Lumia can read LocalState but cannot write to it (every
         upload form answers HTTP 500), so the appx is the only channel that reaches the device. The
         on/off switch is the `enabled=` line inside the file itself, for the same reason: a marker file
         in LocalState could not be delivered. A release build sets enabled=0 and the player stays
         silent. Format and rationale: Src\harness\Assets\navseq.txt.
